  "routes": "journey",
  "mapLabel": "North India, c. 725 to 1090 CE",
  "note": "The early Pratihara capital is disputed (Ujjain or Bhinmal and Jalore); chapter 1 is placed at Ujjain. The Sindh pin marks the Arab province, at its capital Mansura. Dates of kings are approximate.",
